								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11491#msg11491">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 07:51:16 am &#187;</span></td>
