	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11492"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=328" title="View the profile of maxo">maxo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 20<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=328"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11492#msg11492"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11492#msg11492">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 09:34:18 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The time of day a player logged in was the largest effect on what content they would see until the Dallas fan faire.&nbsp; I bent every SOE person there&#039;s ear about changing it so spawns were 1-24 hours after patch.&nbsp; It changed about 2 weeks later so I imagine I was not the only person saying it or maybe I was since they seemed astonished at the idea for some reason.<br /><br />Before spawns were random, most mobs were dead when I got home from work.&nbsp; You can&#039;t kill something that is already dead.&nbsp; &nbsp;In those days, people who could log on at 3pm cst right after patch owned the game.&nbsp; Wooo.. l33t skill to log on at 3pm.<br /><br />That being said.&nbsp; I think SOE took some of the heart out of the game with all this instanced content.&nbsp; It&#039;s just not the same game.&nbsp; I also think they have repeatedly wimped up the content until now anyone who is not an idiot can do most of it- its just a matter of putting in your time in the seat.<br /><br />The POP flagging situation REALLY took the recruiting pressure off of guilds like the Brews.&nbsp; Guilds that used to poach our best members just vanished from the server for months.&nbsp; You couldn&#039;t grind with them casually so they couldn&#039;t poach you any more.&nbsp; Once the poaching stopped, things finally crystalized.&nbsp; Once we had random spawn times, we finally were seeing mobs and able to kill them.&nbsp; We currently run about 12 months behind the top guild on the server playing about 8 hours a week.<br /><br />I think UQUA had a lot of effect on the upper guilds.&nbsp; Lots of very well equipped and AA&#039;d people quit the game before it was fixed.&nbsp; And a lot of #2 and #3 guilds on all the servers caught up with the #1 guild while everyone was stuck at Uqua.<br /><br />From what I&#039;m hearing of OOW, they have some fun stuff there where you have to pay attention to emotes and stuff (kinda anti-Bot stuff).&nbsp; <br /><br />Of course in the end, this is a game folks.&nbsp; And it won&#039;t even be around 20 years from now like football.&nbsp; I would not invest too much of yourself into it.&nbsp; But then again, I&#039;m a casual player.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11493"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 139<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11493#msg11493"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11493#msg11493">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 09:49:43 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11492#msg11492">Quote from: maxo on September 30, 2004, 09:34:18 am</a></div><div class="quote">We currently run about 12 months behind the top guild on the server playing about 8 hours a week.<br /></div><br />We may only raid 8 hours a week, but most of us play a lot more then that... both exploring new content, working on quests, and grinding out the levels and AAs.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
