							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11562#msg11562"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11562#msg11562">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> October 04, 2004, 12:26:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Competition always made the game fun.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
